{"id":"34a172f6f4cae8dd","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-glb-ordinal-truncation.md","title":"GLB Ordinal Truncation Equivalences","display":"lem-glb-ordinal-truncation — GLB Ordinal Truncation Equivalences","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-glb-ordinal-truncation","aliases":["89-lem-glb-ordinal-truncation"],"display":"lem-glb-ordinal-truncation — GLB Ordinal Truncation Equivalences","depends_on":["[[89-lem-small-ordinal-operations]]","[[89-lem-glb-ordinal-comparison]]","[[89-df-glb-logic]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-glb-ordinal-truncation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-glb-ordinal-truncation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-glb-ordinal-truncation — GLB Ordinal Truncation Equivalences"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b21577b9c610fde4\" href=\"?note=b21577b9c610fde4\" title=\"89-lem-small-ordinal-operations\">89-lem-small-ordinal-operations</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"15ef78b25d5206a3\" href=\"?note=15ef78b25d5206a3\" title=\"89-lem-glb-ordinal-comparison\">89-lem-glb-ordinal-comparison</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a9efa2261b8f73c\" href=\"?note=5a9efa2261b8f73c\" title=\"89-df-glb-logic\">89-df-glb-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5a9efa2261b8f73c\" href=\"?note=5a9efa2261b8f73c\" title=\"89-df-glb-logic\">89-df-glb-logic</a> 的双模态定理集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathcal O\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathcal O\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\omega\">\\(j\\in\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\alpha=\\Box_0D_\\alpha\">\\(H_\\alpha=\\Box_0D_\\alpha\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_j=\\Box_1^j\\bot\">\\(C_j=\\Box_1^j\\bot\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}glb\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}truncation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(\\neg C_j\\to(H_\\alpha\\leftrightarrow H_{\\alpha^{-j}}))\\in\\mathrm{GLB},\\\\\n&amp;d\\alpha\\ge j\\Longrightarrow\n(D_{\\alpha^{+j}}\\leftrightarrow(H_\\alpha\\lor C_j))\\in\\mathrm{GLB}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}glb\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}truncation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(\\neg C_j\\to(H_\\alpha\\leftrightarrow H_{\\alpha^{-j}}))\\in\\mathrm{GLB},\\\\\n&amp;d\\alpha\\ge j\\Longrightarrow\n(D_{\\alpha^{+j}}\\leftrightarrow(H_\\alpha\\lor C_j))\\in\\mathrm{GLB}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 16 章 pp.214–215，Lemma 5。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>第一式：按定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{\\alpha^{+j}}=H_{\\alpha^{-j}}\\lor C_j\">\\(D_{\\alpha^{+j}}=H_{\\alpha^{-j}}\\lor C_j\\)</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha&lt;\\alpha^{+j}\">\\(\\alpha&lt;\\alpha^{+j}\\)</span>，比较引理给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\alpha\\to D_{\\alpha^{+j}}\">\\(H_\\alpha\\to D_{\\alpha^{+j}}\\)</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg C_j\">\\(\\neg C_j\\)</span> 下推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{\\alpha^{-j}}\">\\(H_{\\alpha^{-j}}\\)</span>。反向来自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha^{-j}\\le\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha^{-j}\\le\\alpha\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 的蕴含单调性。</p>\n<p>第二式：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\alpha\\ge j\">\\(d\\alpha\\ge j\\)</span>，没有指数被截断；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha^{+j}\">\\(\\alpha^{+j}\\)</span> 的最后一项正是新增 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span>，其删尾码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha=0\">\\(\\alpha=0\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d0=\\infty\">\\(d0=\\infty\\)</span>，同一条定义仍适用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-lem-small-ordinal-operations","status":"resolved","id":"b21577b9c610fde4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-small-ordinal-operations]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-glb-ordinal-comparison","status":"resolved","id":"15ef78b25d5206a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-glb-ordinal-comparison]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-glb-logic","status":"resolved","id":"5a9efa2261b8f73c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-glb-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-glb-logic","status":"resolved","id":"5a9efa2261b8f73c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}$ 为 [[89-df-glb-logic]] 的双模态定理集。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathcal O","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"H_\\alpha=\\Box_0D_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"C_j=\\Box_1^j\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}glb\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}truncation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&(\\neg C_j\\to(H_\\alpha\\leftrightarrow H_{\\alpha^{-j}}))\\in\\mathrm{GLB},\\\\\n&d\\alpha\\ge j\\Longrightarrow\n(D_{\\alpha^{+j}}\\leftrightarrow(H_\\alpha\\lor C_j))\\in\\mathrm{GLB}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"D_{\\alpha^{+j}}=H_{\\alpha^{-j}}\\lor C_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha<\\alpha^{+j}","display":false},{"tex":"H_\\alpha\\to D_{\\alpha^{+j}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg C_j","display":false},{"tex":"H_{\\alpha^{-j}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha^{-j}\\le\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"d\\alpha\\ge j","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha^{+j}","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha=0","display":false},{"tex":"d0=\\infty","display":false}],"bytes":1559,"backlinks":[{"id":"6e228478af514c07","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0413066aa327a245","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-172","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"序数与公式：[[89-df-small-ordinal-code]] → [[89-lem-small-ordinal-operations]] → [[89-df-glb-ordinal-formulas]] → [[89-lem-glb-box-absorption]] → [[89-lem-glb-ordinal-comparison]] → [[89-lem-glb-ordinal-truncation]]。"}],"outgoing":["b21577b9c610fde4","15ef78b25d5206a3","5a9efa2261b8f73c"]}